  "name": "Full-Scale Customer Acquisition and Retention System",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 - CAPTURE EVERY LEAD AND CUSTOMER EVENT\n\nForm fills, purchases and signups all land in one place and get cleaned into the same shape.",
        "height": 780,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "74a0abf0-824b-5e3e-a56d-680536273d37",
      "name": "Section - 1 - CAPTURE EVERY LEAD AND CUSTOMER EVENT",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 - DECIDE WHO THEY ARE AND WHAT THEY GET NEXT\n\nClaude looks the person up in the CRM and picks the next best message instead of a fixed drip.",
        "height": 780,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d0936a3c-8ca7-50b8-9ab1-7c6268d20347",
      "name": "Section - 2 - DECIDE WHO THEY ARE AND WHAT THEY GET NEXT",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 - ACQUISITION: WELCOME THE NEW ONES\n\nBrand new contacts get the welcome and the first offer straight away, while interest is highest.",
        "height": 780,
        "width": 220,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "76119aad-4cec-512e-9917-184caaac006f",
      "name": "Section - 3 - ACQUISITION: WELCOME THE NEW ONES",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1680,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 - NURTURE AND RETENTION: KEEP THEM MOVING\n\nNurture loops a personalized touch every two days until they engage, capped so nobody gets spammed. Quiet customers get a win back instead.",
        "height": 780,
        "width": 1040,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "dd220128-8eaa-5887-a162-f7404bec05fa",
      "name": "Section - 4 - NURTURE AND RETENTION: KEEP THEM MOVING",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2060,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5 - MEASURE, REPORT, AND CATCH FAILURES\n\nEvery send updates the CRM and logs a metrics row, and Monday morning the numbers land in Slack.",
